  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Last year, this company did not pay a cent of federal tax in the USA,
    \nand it is hard to get information if it does in other places in the world.
    \nThe company has mastered the art of avoidance, exploiting foreign tax havens,
    and jumping through seemingly infinite loopholes that accountants apparently
    willingly work out for them.\n\nAlongside their spending on lobbying (which have
    increased by almost 420% since 2012) and the fact that they sell facial recognition
    software to law enforcement and ICE tells a story about lies and exploitation.\n\nWithout
    even mentioning the environmental implications of promising two day shipping
    and the increasing use of plastic and paper packaging, a company who hides behind
    a successful front while operating in the shadows isn't a safe and sustainable
    investment."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c607bc552d27574281ceda981cb73ea, type: 2}
