  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "It is the only company left in the top 10 due to the fact that \nclimate
    sustainable companies have pushed the others out of the way. \nThis company has
    poor prospects, with decreasing revenues from \n$466 billion in 2008 to about
    half in 2017.\n\nMoreover, legal risks in the fossil fuel industry are growing.
    \nGroups of investors, institutions, customers, cities, and American states are
    suing fossil companies over their environmental impact, and their neglect to
    report the risks associated with fossil fuels for decades. \n\nInvesting your
    money in this company does not only contribute to more c02 compared to climate
    sustainable companies, but you also risk losing the money invested."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c607bc552d27574281ceda981cb73ea, type: 2}
